              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ji̱n Ɛdhra, kɛ ŋäc Kuɔthdu min tekɛ ji̱, kuany kua̱r luɔ̱ɔ̱kni kɛnɛ rueec ti ba nɛy diaal tin te wi̱i̱ni Kuec Kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh, nɛy diaal tin ŋa̱ckɛ ŋuɔ̱t Kuɔthdu. Kä nɛy ti /cakɛ ŋäc bikɛ ŋi̱eec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
