        {
          "text": "A puɔ̱th tekɛ Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth gua̱a̱ri, min läth nɛmɛ lɔɔc kua̱r, min ci luak Kuɔth Nhial in te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm moc lɔ̱ɔ̱l, ",
